flowchart TD
 S1["1. Decompose tasks and establish the baseline\nMeasure current work, handoffs, delay, rework, quality, burden, and role boundaries."]
 S2["2. Identify AI–human allocation options\nSeparate tasks suitable for automation, augmentation, review, escalation, and human-only performance."]
 S1 --> S2
 S3["3. Redesign workflow and roles\nDefine new responsibilities, supervision, competencies, fallback, and downstream capacity."]
 S2 --> S3
 S4["4. Implement a controlled pilot\nTrain users, monitor adoption, collect workflow evidence, and preserve reversibility."]
 S3 --> S4
 S5["5. Measure gross and net productivity\nSubtract review, correction, coordination, downtime, and displaced work from gross time saved."]
 S4 --> S5
 S6["6. Convert released capacity into realized value\nDocument redeployment, improved quality, reduced delay, avoided harm, or other verified outcomes."]
 S5 --> S6
 S7["7. Adapt and sustain\nAddress implementation determinants, professional effects, maintenance, and scale conditions."]
 S6 --> S7
